# BioDynaX Core Rules

BioDynaX is a research software project.

The current scientific scope is intentionally narrow:

known biological dynamical graph
+
known mechanisms
+
exactly one unknown destruction mechanism
+
mechanistic inference and validation

Do not expand the project into a general CRN solver, general SINDy replacement,
generic neural ODE framework, LLM biology platform, GUI product, or unrelated
scientific computing toolkit.

Prefer scientifically coherent, composable changes over feature count.

Before changing architecture, inspect the current implementation.

Do not rewrite working systems without evidence.

Do not create speculative abstractions merely because they may be useful later.

The authoritative long-term vision is:

docs/research/BIO-DYNAX-VISION.md

The current forensic repository audit is:

docs/research/FORENSIC-AUDIT.md